# Supabase Configuration
# Create a new Supabase project for staging/local development and place the URL and anon key here.
# DO NOT put the service_role key here.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=your-staging-supabase-url
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-staging-supabase-anon-key

# Other configurations (if any)
# PROHIBITED: NEVER add GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY or GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY (unavailable in Vietnam & hard-blocked in next.config.ts).
